  "description": "GuardRegex is a lightweight utility library for .NET regular expressions.\n      It provides RegexEscaper for regex metacharacter escaping/unescaping and GuardRegex for null validation, maximum input length validation, and timeout-enforced Regex execution.\n      Exceptions from the underlying System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex engine are transparently propagated.",
  "id": "GuardRegex",
  "isPrerelease": false,
