  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.0\n\n      Initial stable release of GuardRegex.\n\n      - RegexEscaper: extended escaping and unescaping support for regex metacharacters.\n      - GuardRegex: protective wrapper for Regex execution with null checks, maximum input length validation, and timeout enforcement.\n      - Transparent propagation of exceptions from System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex.\n      - MIT License.",
